{"author_html":"See <b>user</b> in the \"File history\" section.","byte_length":10572,"changes":"None; original bytes","credit_html":"<p>For shape and stroke order :\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"900\" data-file-height=\"600\"></span></span> </span><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Republic_of_China\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Republic of China\">Taiwan</a> (ROC): <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://stroke-order.learningweb.moe.edu.tw/home.do\">常用國字標準字體筆順手冊</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://www.edu.tw/files/site_content/M0001/bishuen/bs1.htm?open\" href=\"https://www.edu.tw/files/site_content/M0001/bishuen/bs1.htm?open\">Stroke order 14 rules</a>), by the Taiwan Ministry of Education. <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:ISBN\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">ISBN</span></a></span> <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/957-00-7082-X\" title=\"Special:BookSources/957-00-7082-X\">957-00-7082-X</a> (Authoritative, available online)</li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Flag_of_the_People%27s_Republic_of_China.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_People%27s_Republic_of_China.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Flag_of_the_People%27s_Republic_of_China.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_People%27s_Republic_of_China.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"900\" data-file-height=\"600\"></span></span> </span><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/People%27s_Republic_of_China\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"People's Republic of China\">China</a> (PRC): <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/54/%E7%8E%B0%E4%BB%A3%E6%B1%89%E8%AF%AD%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%94%E9%A1%BA%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83.pdf\">现代汉语通用字笔顺规范</a>, 453pages, 1997, editeur: 语文出版社, ISBN:7801262018 (Authoritative, available online)</li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Flag_of_Japan.svg/40px-Flag_of_Japan.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Flag_of_Japan.svg/60px-Flag_of_Japan.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"900\" data-file-height=\"600\"></span></span> </span><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Japan\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Japan\">Japan</a> : 筆順指導の手びき (Hitsujun shidō no tebiki), 1958. <b>Note:</b> Since 1977, the Japanese Ministry of Education recommend to publishers to simply <i>« follow commonsensical [strokes] orders which are widely accepted in the society ».</i></li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-borde